5,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's keep this logical. I'll be observing everyone's speech patterns and consistency to find the werewolf. Does anyone have a specific strategy they intend to use for this game?,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm not really sure. I'll just try my best to listen to everyone. I don't want to make a mistake and vote for the wrong person... so I'll probably follow what the others think.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Following the majority is a dangerous strategy, Daisuke. It only helps the werewolf hide. I will be analyzing logical inconsistencies in our arguments to identify who is lying. Let's focus on evidence rather than intuition.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Asuka. Intuition is unreliable in a game of deception. I will be focusing on the structural consistency of each person's claims. If a statement contradicts a previously established fact, it is a red flag.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all. I think it's important that we stay friendly and supportive of one another while we search for the truth. I'll be listening carefully to everyone's feelings and reactions.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, while feelings are interesting, they can be easily faked by a werewolf. @Daisuke, relying on others makes you an easy target for manipulation. Do you think you can form your own opinions as we get more data?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll try. It's just that I'm worried I'll misread something and cause trouble for everyone. But if you think it's important, I'll do my best to think for myself.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, hesitation is natural, but indecision is a liability. We need everyone to be an active observer. If you simply mirror others, you become a tool for the werewolf to steer the vote. Focus on the facts.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, your hesitation is a variable that can be exploited. To be useful to the village, you must provide your own reasoning, however simple. Without individual input, we cannot establish a baseline for your behavior.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, please don't feel pressured. It's okay to be cautious. Let's all try to be patient with each other so that everyone feels comfortable sharing their thoughts. Harmony will help us think more clearly, don't you think?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Midori, harmony is fine, but we shouldn't let it cloud our judgment. @Asuka, @Ryuji, since you both value logic and structure, how exactly do you plan to handle the Seer's information once it emerges?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not sure how to handle it. If the Seer tells us someone is a werewolf, it seems obvious, but... what if the werewolf is pretending to be the Seer? I'm scared of believing the wrong person.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Daisuke, that is exactly why we must analyze the timing and consistency of the claim. A fake Seer often waits to see who is trusted before claiming the role. We must cross-reference their ""findings"" with observed behavior.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Misaki, the Seer's information is a primary data point, but it must be treated as a claim until verified. I will analyze whether the Seer's targets align with a logical strategy to protect the village or a hidden agenda.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, it's very natural to be worried about that. But we're all in this together. If we support each other and listen carefully, I'm sure we can figure out who is telling the truth.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Misaki,,It seems we have a clear divide between those prioritizing logic and those prioritizing emotion. I'll be watching for any sudden shifts in these stances. Let's proceed to the first night.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope I can be helpful. I'll try to pay attention to everything everyone says. Good luck to all of us... I really hope we can find the werewolf without losing anyone.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Good luck is not a strategy. I will be observing how each of you adapts your rhetoric once the first night's results are in. Let us see who remains consistent and who begins to falter.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,Consistency is the only metric that matters. I will be monitoring for any deviations in your logic as the game progresses. Let us see whose arguments hold up under scrutiny.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I hope we can all get along and work through this together. I'll be doing my best to support everyone. Let's have a peaceful night, and I look forward to talking with you all again tomorrow.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
